# Requested as reviewers automatically. Paths are matched last-rule-wins, so
# put the general rule first and narrow it below.
#
# This is only enforced when the branch ruleset sets require_code_owner_review,
# which .github/settings.yml leaves off by default.
#
# Keep in sync with MAINTAINERS.md.

* @{{ORG_NAME}}/maintainers

# Changes here alter what runs with repository credentials, so they get a
# closer look than the rest of the tree.
/.github/                @{{ORG_NAME}}/maintainers
/SECURITY.md             @{{ORG_NAME}}/maintainers
